## Technical Highlights

### 1. Key Engineering Achievement
- Detail your methodology, calculations, simulations, or experiments.
- Highlight metrics, numbers, and concrete results (e.g. weight saved, efficiency gained, error margins).

### 2. Adding Visual Figures
You can embed figures with responsive sizing and captions like this:

```liquid
<div class="row justify-content-center">
  <div class="col-sm-10 mt-3 mt-md-0">
    {% include figure.liquid 
      loading="eager" 
      path="assets/img/your_image.png" 
      title="Caption Title" 
      class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" 
    %}
  </div>
</div>
<div class="caption">
  Figure 1: Describe the schematic, chart, or CAD render here.
</div>
```

Or simply use standard markdown:
`![Caption](assets/img/your_image.png)`

### 3. LaTeX Math Equations
You can write inline math like $E = mc^2$ or display math blocks:

$$
\vec{F}_{EM} = \vec{j} \times \vec{B} = (j_r B_z - j_z B_r)\hat{\theta} + (j_\theta B_r - j_r B_\theta)\hat{z}
$$

### 4. Code Blocks
```python
import numpy as np

def calculate_thrust(mass_flow, exhaust_velocity):
    return mass_flow * exhaust_velocity
```
